        <mxCell id="rag_detail" value="&lt;b&gt;rag_evaluator.py — per golden query:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Load golden queries (eval_type=golden_query)&lt;br&gt;2. Qdrant search → top_k chunks&lt;br&gt;3. Embed query → compute RAG score (cosine)&lt;br&gt;4. Bedrock LLM judge → faithfulness + relevance&lt;br&gt;5. Write: eval#rag#ts to evaluations_table&lt;br&gt;6. Write to hitl_table if score &lt; HITL_THRESHOLD"
          style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;"
          vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="453" y="420" width="345" height="130" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

